			<div class="content" id="post-content-4270814">
									

<p>You’re close, though I don’t want to give it all away haha. I’ve been away from writing from some time, it is to be known that this SCP will be getting a major grammatical upgrade and an added section for others to add their reports of test games and such. I’ve just been having a lot going on stopping me from doing so. So there will be more info and further clarity in the future but I am not saying it is incomplete.</p>
<p>As for the final game time. I wanted to really emphasize the purpose of the “Gamemaster”. Without spewing it all over. I wish I had more know how to make text fade into something else on these pages but the idea was more. You go to view this classified document, okay level 5 security blah blah. But all you see is [Data Expunged] not as like a filler or replacement for data but that is what is actually written. That then in of itself is a security measure created similarly to SCP foundation ones but is clearly a grade above. Which reveals the true first document. The document gives more insight into this “Game Time” and is not supposed be entirely understood as of this moment. What is to be know is that game time is set to start when the universe is at its unstoppable end. Like I said you’re close, but not just there.</p>
<p>I will be adding more to this and was planning to piece another SCP and a few tales together into one larger story involving the “Gamemaster” and what was mentioned in the SCP file. I have much bigger plans I just didn’t know if anyone was interested in reading them is all.</p>

